    "decodedMemory": "8K RGBA+mipmaps is about 171 MiB; three 2K RGBA PBR maps with mipmaps are about 64 MiB",
    "cacheBound": "dispose the 4K after a committed 8K swap; retain only the current inactive theme for same-page reopen; acquiring a different theme evicts the prior inactive textures",
    "ground": "720 m subdivided world-space land/snow grid and water seabed; the subject floor stays level while low-frequency relief, irregular horizon feathers, translucent distance haze and sparse non-blocking terrain anchors break the stage-like horizontal cut; contact cues are feathered blobs, not physically projected shadows"
  },
